# property-api requests (VS Code "REST Client" extension: humao.rest-client)
# Needs LINZ_API_KEY in the repo-root .env (see .env.example); /healthz works without it.
# Start: see api-requests/README.md

@property = http://localhost:8081

### Health check
GET {{property}}/healthz

### Address search (prefix match, up to 8 Auckland addresses, ~2 s)
GET {{property}}/v1/addresses?q=740 Sandringham

### PropertyContext for a LINZ address_id (740 Sandringham Road Extension, a public reserve)
# @name context
GET {{property}}/v1/property-context?address_id=2100210

### PropertyContext for 44 Lorne Street (Auckland Central Library)
GET {{property}}/v1/property-context?address_id=1132249

### GeoJSON for the development map (not part of the hand-off contract)
GET {{property}}/v1/map?address_id=2100210

### End to end: send the PropertyContext above straight to rules-api
# Run the "context" request first; REST Client fills in its response body.
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/rules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "property_context": {{context.response.body.$}},
  "user_inputs": { "deposit": 60000, "household_income": 120000, "existing_debts": 10000 }
}
